<view class="page" wx:if="{{profile}}"><view class="eyebrow">MY HUAMAO / 我的花猫</view><view wx:if="{{!editing}}"><view class="account-hero"><view class="account-avatar"><image wx:if="{{avatar}}" src="{{avatar}}" mode="aspectFill"/><image wx:elif="{{identityType}}" src="/assets/identities/{{identityType}}.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text wx:else>❀</text></view><view class="account-name">{{profile.nickname}}</view><view class="identity-title">{{identityTitle}}</view><view class="muted">和花草、毛孩子，一起好好生活。</view><button bindtap="edit">编辑资料与身份 ↗</button></view><view class="account-stats"><button bindtap="favorites"><view class="stat-number">{{favoriteCount}}</view><view>植物收藏</view></button><button bindtap="myExperiences"><view class="stat-number">{{records.length}}</view><view>我的经验</view></button></view><view class="growth-entry" bindtap="growth"><view class="name">❀　花猫成长册</view><view class="muted">每日打卡 · 认识植物 · 解锁徽章　→</view></view><view class="section">我的记录</view><view class="account-menu"><button bindtap="favorites">♡　我的植物收藏　→</button><button bindtap="myExperiences">✎　我的养宠经验　→</button><button bindtap="edit">◎　账号与个人资料　→</button></view><view wx:if="{{showExperiences}}"><view class="section">我的养宠经验</view><view class="muted">记录养护与防护的实际体验，仅在本机保存。</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{!records.length}}"><view class="name">还没有写下经验</view><view class="body">在植物详情页记录你的养护心得或防护做法。</view></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id"><view class="name">{{item.plantName}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.category}} · {{item.pet}} · {{item.date}}</view><view class="body account-record">{{item.content}}</view><button data-id="{{item.plantId}}" bindtap="openPlant">查看植物与管理经验 →</button></view></view><view class="section">关于花猫</view><view class="card"><view class="name">使用与隐私说明</view><view class="muted">头像昵称由你主动填写，手机号需额外授权。当前收藏与经验仅保存在本机，清理设备数据可能丢失记录。</view><view class="name about-title">资料来源与纠错</view><view class="muted">植物详情附原始资料、证据范围与复核状态。发现问题请记录学名、描述与来源链接，线上反馈渠道尚未开放。</view></view><view class="notice">{{profile.mode === 'demo' ? '本机体验版 · 尚未接入微信登录。' : '微信账号'}} 收藏与经验暂不跨设备同步，公共社区尚未开放。</view><button bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></view><view wx:if="{{editing}}"><button bindtap="edit">‹ 返回我的花猫</button><button class="favorites-shortcut" bindtap="favorites">♡ 我的植物收藏 →</button><view class="title">你好，铲屎官。</view><view class="identity-title">{{identityTitle}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{profile.mode === 'demo'}}">本机体验账号 · 不是微信登录。经验按本机账号分别保存，不会同步到其他设备。</view><view class="card"><button class="avatar" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="chooseAvatar"><image wx:if="{{avatar}}" src="{{avatar}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else>❀</text></button><view class="muted">点击选择头像（由你主动选择）</view><view class="section">我的昵称</view><input class="nickname" type="nickname" placeholder="输入或选择昵称" maxlength="20" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="input" bindblur="input"/><view class="section">我的养宠身份</view><view class="muted">选择你的养宠情况，领取专属称号。随时可以修改。</view><view class="identity-options"><view wx:for="{{identities}}" wx:key="value" class="identity-option {{identityType === item.value ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="chooseIdentity"><image class="identity-face" src="/assets/identities/{{item.value}}.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="identity-copy"><view class="identity-name">{{item.title}}</view><view class="identity-label">{{item.label}}</view></view><view class="identity-check">{{identityType === item.value ? '✓' : ''}}</view></view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存资料</button></view><view class="card"><view class="name">手机号</view><view class="muted">{{profile.phoneMasked || '尚未绑定'}} · 仅自己可见<view>用于账号联系与后续找回，当前不提供短信登录。可不绑定。</view></view><button wx:if="{{profile.mode === 'wechat'}}" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="phone" disabled="{{busy}}">{{profile.phoneMasked ? '重新授权绑定' : '授权绑定微信手机号'}}</button><button wx:else bindtap="localPhone">了解手机号授权</button></view><view class="muted">账号编号：{{profile.id}}<view>当前是普通注册账号，暂不包含付费会员服务。</view></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view></view></view>
